### 🟡 Missing Features / Incomplete Pages

| # | Feature | Status | Notes |
|---|---------|--------|-------|
| 4 | **Order status tracking (user-facing)** | Partial | Only shows statuses as text labels (`pending`, `paid`, `shipped`, etc.); no shipping tracking number field or visual timeline |
| 5 | **Admin: Edit Category** | Missing | Admin panel has no "edit category" button/form; only add + (implicit delete via product reassignment) |
| 6 | **Admin: Delete Category** | Missing | No delete button rendered for categories in the UI |
| 7 | **Admin: Order Management tab** | Missing | Admins can view orders on the Dashboard but can't change order status (e.g. mark as `shipped`, `delivered`) — no admin orders tab |
| 8 | **Analytics: Event tracking on frontend** | Missing | The backend `/api/analytics/track` endpoint exists, but the frontend **never calls it** — no product view, add-to-cart, or purchase events are actually sent |
| 9 | **Brands / Collections — backend missing slug lookup** | Partial | `brands.py` and `collections.py` routers exist, but check whether a `/brands/:slug` endpoint for filtering products by brand is wired up |
| 10 | **Wishlist / Saved Items** | Missing | No wishlist table in schema, no UI, no backend endpoint |
| 11 | **Product Reviews / Ratings** | Missing | No `reviews` table, no UI on product detail page, no backend endpoint |
| 12 | **Search — backend full-text search** | Basic | Current search filters by `ilike` on name; no Postgres full-text search (`tsvector`) or relevance ranking |
| 13 | **Email notifications** | Missing | No order confirmation, payment receipt, or shipping notification emails |
| 14 | **Password reset / change** | Missing | Dashboard has no "change password" section; Supabase supports this but UI is absent |
| 15 | **Coupon / Promo codes** | Missing | No `coupons` table, no coupon input on Checkout, no backend validation |
| 16 | **COD / multiple payment methods** | Missing | Only Razorpay; no Cash on Delivery option |
| 17 | **Multiple addresses** | Missing | Only one default shipping address per user; no saved address book |
| 18 | **Pagination in Admin product list** | Missing | Products tab lists all products; no pagination for large catalogs |
| 19 | **`compare_at_price` schema constraint issue** | Schema Bug | Schema has `CHECK (compare_at_price >= price)` — this means you can't set a compare price lower than the current price, which is backward (compare_at should be the *original* higher price) |

